  <section class="page-heading"><h1>About</h1></section>
  <section class="about-copy prose">
    <p>Hello, I’m Mateo. I’m originally from Colombia and currently live in Berlin.</p>
    <p>I’m a deeply curious person, and one of my favorite things in life is understanding how systems work. I studied engineering physics at university and have worked in research, software development, and data science. Along the way, I’ve built lab equipment, apps, hardware, and tools that help people work with data.</p>
    <p>Today I work at Vinted. In my spare time, I build things, from custom home automation systems to interesting kites.</p>
